# Git Workflow Rules

- NEVER commit or push directly to `main`.
- Always create a feature branch: `feature/<short-description>`.
- Always open a Pull Request for review before merging.
- Never force-push or rewrite history on shared branches.
- Stop and ask before any `git reset --hard` or history rewrite.
